<title>MALAYSIA: Ayer Hitam asks for share suspension.</title>
<headline>Ayer Hitam asks for share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayer Hitam Tin Dredging Malaysia Bhd said it has requested that trading in its shares be suspended from Monday pending an announcement.</p>
<p>A company statement, sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Friday, did not elaborate. Officials were not available on Saturday for further comment.</p>
<p>Shares of the property development firm closed at 4.86 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
